    <deploymentStatus>Deployed</deploymentStatus>
    <description>Who gets alerted when a Meta lead fails to sync, and how. Replaces the old implicit rule (every holder of the Meta_Lead_Integration_Admin permission set gets a bell notification, one static email list) with an explicit, per-User, per-org list managed on the Meta Lead Capture Setup page — each row picks a User and a Channel (Bell / Email / Both). Read by MetaLeadSyncFailureNotifier.</description>
